  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 145 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA posted the vecuronium bromide shortage on 2020-05-06 and it has remained on the list for 78 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An FDA inspection of Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited ended 2019-12-13 and was classified OAI with eight observations including absence of written procedures and control procedures to monitor and validate performance, 145 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D7", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited is a registered plant on a vecuronium bromide label with operations for analysis, manufacture, and pack.",
      "cites": ["E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent FDA inspections of Eugia in 2024-02-02 and 2026-02-06 were also classified OAI, and a Warning Letter was issued 2024-08-15.",
      "cites": ["E29", "E31", "E32"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 11 days on hand and Corvale General has 18 days on hand at current usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-selected buyer option is to purchase from Mylan Institutional LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and uses MYLAN LABS LTD.",
      "cites": ["D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A pharmacist-approved therapeutic interchange to the same product from Gland Pharma Limited (NDC 68083013910) was authorized on 2026-01-27.",
      "cites": ["D10", "E42"]
    }
  ]
}
